  "independent_review": {
    "innma": "Clearly older than previous big-eyed bust: narrow half-moon eyes, visible round spectacles/bridge, pale forehead wisps, sloping low shoulders, rounded hunched standing silhouette, floral apron and towel-folding signature. Distressed eyes are still stylized but stay narrow and hooded.",
    "seryeon": "Adult fox identity now differs from squirrel children: pointed muzzle/triangular ears, narrow half-lidded eyes, lean long legs and angular coat shoulders, asymmetrical smirk. Distressed state visibly crumples papers in furry paws.",
    "scope": "Separate field fullbody and dialogue bust drawings, same wardrobe and face per row. No human hands or nails. This pair differentiates age/silhouette; not a claim that every character in the game has been reviewed or unified."
  }
